        "position": [0.22, 1.68, 2.1],
        "target": [0.0, 1.22, -2.9],
        "fov": 35.0
      }
    },
    "choreography_notes": "The shot opens from an elevated crane perspective perched above the uppermost student tier. The camera performs a smooth descending boom float down along the tiered seating rake, gliding over curved desk edges and settling into an authoritative presenter framing before the lectern and chalkboard wall."
  },
